# Model weights and training artefacts never belong in git: they are large, they are not
# reproducible from source, and they must be installed locally (see models/README.md).
# The application never downloads or retrains them on its own; it reports them as missing.
/models/weights/
/models/**/*.pth
/models/**/*.pt
*.pth
*.pt
*.keras
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

